flowchart TB
    subgraph BrowserBoundary["Browser / Untrusted Client Boundary"]
        BrowserClient["Client Browser"]
        ClientPublicConfig["Public Assets, CSRF Token, Workspace Slug"]
    end

    subgraph DjangoApplicationSecurity["Django Security & Authorization Perimeter"]
        SSLProxyCheck["SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER & Security Headers"]
        CSRFMiddleware["CSRF Token Verification (State-Changing HTTP POST)"]
        SessionAuth["Session & Contributor ID Authentication Guard"]
        WorkspaceIsolation["@workspace_member_required Multi-Tenant Isolation"]
        FileValidation["File Upload Validation (Size, Extension, MIME, Magic Bytes)"]
        HTMLSanitizer["Bleach Markdown & HTML Input Sanitizer"]
    end

    subgraph DataStoragePerimeter["Internal Data Storage Perimeter (Isolated)"]
        PostgresMetadata[("PostgreSQL: User Data, Relational Models & File Metadata")]
        SupabaseStorageBucket[("Supabase Private/Public Storage Bucket (Raw Binaries)")]
    end

    subgraph SecretBoundary["Protected Environment Secrets Boundary (Never in Browser/Git)"]
        SecretKeys["DJANGO_SECRET_KEY, DATABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY"]
    end

    BrowserClient -->|HTTPS Request| SSLProxyCheck
    SSLProxyCheck --> CSRFMiddleware
    CSRFMiddleware --> SessionAuth
    SessionAuth --> WorkspaceIsolation
    WorkspaceIsolation --> HTMLSanitizer
    WorkspaceIsolation --> FileValidation

    FileValidation -->|Store Metadata Only| PostgresMetadata
    FileValidation -->|Stream Binary via Secret Key| SupabaseStorageBucket
    
    SecretKeys -.->|Injected via Server Environment Variables| DjangoApplicationSecurity
    
    BrowserClient -.x|Blocked: Direct access without server mediation| PostgresMetadata
    BrowserClient -.x|Blocked: No secret key in JS / No direct DB access| SecretBoundary
